      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2812623381614685
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "3. It is submitted by counsel for the applicant that charge-sheet has been filed in the matter.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 852,
      "end": 948,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17300792038440704
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The case of present applicant is identical to that of co-accused Naresh Kumar Dehariya who has been enlarged on bail by this Court vide order dated 15/01/2025 passed in M.Cr.C. No.22/2025.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 949,
      "end": 1137,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Naresh Kumar Dehariya",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1014,
          "end": 1035
        },
        {
          "text": "15/01/2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1097,
          "end": 1107
        },
        {
          "text": "M.Cr.C. No.22/2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1118,
          "end": 1136
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22436919808387756
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "The applicant is the husband and there is no direct evidence against the applicant for causing death of his wife.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1138,
      "end": 1251,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5136598348617554
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "The statement of mother of the deceased has been recorded before the Trial Court and she has not supported the prosecution case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1252,
      "end": 1380,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.472539484500885
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "He is in custody since 27/02/2024 and there is no requirement of further custodial interrogation of the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1381,
      "end": 1495,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "27/02/2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1404,
          "end": 1414
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5652052760124207
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "He is ready to abide by all the terms and conditions that may be imposed by this Court while considering his application for grant of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1496,
      "end": 1635,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4511953592300415
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "On these grounds, he prays for NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025:MPHC-JBP:7158 2 MCRC-3491-2025 grant of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1636,
      "end": 1739,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "NEUTRAL CITATION NO. 2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1668,
          "end": 1693
        },
        {
          "text": "MPHC-JBP:7158 2 MCRC-3491-2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 1694,
          "end": 1724
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1908336877822876
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Rajesh Jain vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 5 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/2449245/\n1 4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1740,
      "end": 1861,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rajesh Jain vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1741,
          "end": 1783
        },
        {
          "text": "5 February, 2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1787,
          "end": 1803
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Per contra , the State counsel has vehemently opposed the contentions and submitted that the applicant is the husband of the deceased.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1862,
      "end": 1996,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2932717204093933
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The death has taken place in unnatural circumstances.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 1997,
      "end": 2050,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.44019025564193726
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "The cause of death is Cardio respiratory arrest as a result of Asphyxia due to strangulation.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2051,
      "end": 2144,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4762757122516632
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "There was previous dispute between the deceased and the present applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2145,
      "end": 2219,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4123188853263855
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Earlier three FIRs were registered in Crime No.299/2016, 38/2016 and 152/2015 for offence under Sections 498A, 294, 323, 506, 34 of IPC and in all these cases, the matter was compromised between the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2220,
      "end": 2427,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Crime No.299/2016, 38/2016 and 152/2015",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 2258,
          "end": 2297
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 498A",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2316,
          "end": 2329
        },
        {
          "text": "294",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2331,
          "end": 2334
        },
        {
          "text": "323",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2336,
          "end": 2339
        },
        {
          "text": "506",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2341,
          "end": 2344
        },
        {
          "text": "34",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 2346,
          "end": 2348
        },
        {
          "text": "IPC",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2352,
          "end": 2355
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37659314274787903
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Thereafter wife had went to the house of the present applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2428,
      "end": 2491,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4691213369369507
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "Applicant is the husband of the deceased and is having highest responsibility toward her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2492,
      "end": 2581,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4865913987159729
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "He is required to explain that under what circumstances the death has taken place.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 2582,
      "end": 2664,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.44587671756744385
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "There is nothing on record to show that wife was suffering from any ailment or any mental disorder.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2665,
      "end": 2764,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5860925316810608
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "Merely the custody period cannot be a sole ground for grant of bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2765,
      "end": 2833,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5888411998748779
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "Under these circumstances, no case for grant of bail is made out.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2834,
      "end": 2899,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4900241494178772
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "He has prayed for rejection of the bail application.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2900,
      "end": 2952,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31475263833999634
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "5. Considering the overall facts and circumstances of the case as well as the fact that applicant is the husband of the deceased and there is no explanation that under what circumstances the death has taken place, this Court does not deem it appropriate to allow this application.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2953,
      "end": 3234,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.308836430311203
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "6. Accordingly, this bail application is hereby dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 3235,
      "end": 3294,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.08425270020961761
    },
